{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Google將於8月12日的特別發佈會上正式推出Pixel 11系列新機。就在發佈會舉辦前夕，最新的爆料曝光了一組涵蓋Pixel 11、Pixel 11 Pro XL以及摺疊屏機型Pixel 11 Pro Fold的未發佈渲染圖。</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/30ff8a63ac8b174.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/6fccf1dacf2fd1d.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/96682e9f0357594.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/108a3046eae3351.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/f522d05a83df76f.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/eeca9ee4c6db856.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>從本次曝光的渲染圖中可以看到，標準版Pixel 11展示了名為「曜石黑」（Obsidian）的配色，整體呈現出深灰色的質感。Pixel 11 Pro XL同樣以曜石黑配色亮相，其背部經典的相機條模塊相較於標準版Pixel 11有着更為明顯的凸起。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/6797fe008094983.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/d22f28747b6d42a.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/13e41810d6e548e.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/4f67c1c0f27bd7a.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/733cd5772e9e043.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/157be7d8c43309c.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/adbc4564265c0c4.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>摺疊屏機型Pixel 11 Pro Fold同樣曝光了曜石黑外觀。據了解，這款摺疊旗艦預計僅推出「曜石黑」與「松林綠」（Pine）兩種配色；而標準版Pixel 11則將提供更為豐富選擇，包括曜石黑、橄欖綠（Olive）、峽谷紅（Canyon）和迷霧灰（Fog）四種顏色。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/f30af8d676e7eee.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0812/d9f5d5d828b957d.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://fdn.gsmarena.com/imgroot/news/26/08/google-pixel-11-pixel-11-pro-xl-pixel-11-pro-fold-new-renders/popup/-1200x900m/gsmarena_017.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://fdn.gsmarena.com/imgroot/news/26/08/google-pixel-11-pixel-11-pro-xl-pixel-11-pro-fold-new-renders/popup/-1200x900m/gsmarena_018.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://fdn.gsmarena.com/imgroot/news/26/08/google-pixel-11-pixel-11-pro-xl-pixel-11-pro-fold-new-renders/popup/-1200x900m/gsmarena_019.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://fdn.gsmarena.com/imgroot/news/26/08/google-pixel-11-pixel-11-pro-xl-pixel-11-pro-fold-new-renders/popup/-1200x900m/gsmarena_020.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://fdn.gsmarena.com/imgroot/news/26/08/google-pixel-11-pixel-11-pro-xl-pixel-11-pro-fold-new-renders/popup/-1200x900m/gsmarena_021.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://fdn.gsmarena.com/imgroot/news/26/08/google-pixel-11-pixel-11-pro-xl-pixel-11-pro-fold-new-renders/popup/-1200x900m/gsmarena_022.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://fdn.gsmarena.com/imgroot/news/26/08/google-pixel-11-pixel-11-pro-xl-pixel-11-pro-fold-new-renders/popup/-1200x900m/gsmarena_023.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>除了全新的Pixel 11系列手機外，Google還預計將在明天的發佈會上同台推出Pixel Watch 5智能手錶以及全新的追蹤設備Pixel Tag。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T23:59:54.601537+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":453,"images":22,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}